"""PZ254V-11-05P - 1x05 male pin header, 2.54 mm pitch, vertical, through hole.

Datasheet: XFCN PZ254V-11-XX drawing rev. A1 (2024-06-11), LCSC C492404: 2.54 +- 0.05 mm
pitch, 0.64 mm square pins, insulator 2.50 mm high and B = 12.70 mm long for 5 positions,
pins 6.1 mm above and 3.0 mm below the insulator, recommended PCB hole 1.02 mm; 3 A, 500 V AC
withstanding, 20 mOhm contact resistance max, -40 to +105 C.

Footprint: 2.54 mm pitch, 1.0 mm drill, 1.8 mm pads (pad 1 rounded square), pads along +X from
pad 1: the drill and pad of the PZ254V-11-04P package footprint (Altium MicrasLib "HDR MALE
1x4") extended to five positions. The prefix is a config so the header can carry a P or J
designator.
"""

prefix = config(str, default="P", help="Reference designator prefix")

P1 = io(Net)
P2 = io(Net)
P3 = io(Net)
P4 = io(Net)
P5 = io(Net)

Component(
    name="HEADER",
    prefix=prefix,
    symbol=Symbol(library="PZ254V-11-05P.kicad_sym"),
    part=Part(mpn="PZ254V-11-05P", manufacturer="XFCN"),
    pins={"1": P1, "2": P2, "3": P3, "4": P4, "5": P5},
)
